@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ArchiveCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "EmployeeCommandSupport" as Support LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":VersionedAddressBook" as Book MODEL_COLOR

Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Support : find(model, targetId)
Support -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Support : addressBook
Support -> Book : getEmployeeList()
Book --> Support : complete roster
Support --> Command : employee
note over Command, Support
An unknown ID or already archived employee
causes CommandException before mutation.
end note
Command -> Model : archiveEmployee(employee)
activate Model
note right of Model
Create employee.withArchived(true).
Keep every other field and reporting relationship.
end note
Model -> Book : setEmployee(employee, archivedEmployee)
Book --> Model
Model --> Command
deactivate Model
note over Model, Book
Updating the observable list preserves
the installed predicate and sort comparator.
end note
Command -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Command : addressBook
Command -> Book : getEmployeeList()
Book --> Command : complete roster
Command -> Command : count active direct reports
opt active direct reports remain
    Command -> Command : append count and team command hint
end
Command --> Logic : CommandResult(success message)
deactivate Command
note over Logic, Book
LogicManager handles checkpoint, history commit and saving.
See CommandTransaction for success and rollback paths.
end note
@enduml
